{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-sided-markets","title":"双边市场理论","url":"/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/two-sided-markets","wordCount":2005,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-effects-dynamics","title":"网络效应与动态","url":"/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/network-effects-dynamics","wordCount":2046,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-business-models","title":"平台商业模式","url":"/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/platform-business-models","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础理论\n\n本章建立平台经济学的理论基石。三篇文档构成一条递进的逻辑链：从双边市场的定义与判别标准出发，到网络效应如何驱动平台增长与收缩的动态过程，再到平台在不同网络效应结构下演化出的商业模式分类。\n\n学习顺序建议按编号阅读。双边市场理论是后续所有章节的概念基础；网络效应动态则是理解定价策略和竞争格局的关键中间变量；商业模式分类为后续分析提供案例骨架。\n"}